DTSTART:20261018T033000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Reduced Service
UID:c18343aa-ae21-4a37-8bf1-5b840490a21a@c183.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-08T08:49:44&endDate=2026-10-09T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nMinor delays between Paddington and Heathrow Airport / Reading due to an earlier signal failure in the Paddington area. GOOD SERVICE on the rest of the line. 
